From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tompta1 <546706+tompta1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:39:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Input: apple_z2: support J120 HBPP14 and float contact
 reports

Reuse HBPP14 upload and the existing floating-point contact parser for J120. Preserve chip-specific power sequencing, native SPI timing, split PIO replies and empty-reply counter advancement. Validate per-unit calibration and geometry before registering multitouch input; quiesce the IRQ before teardown. Do not expose bring-up capture interfaces or diagnostic module parameters.

Assisted-by: LLM
